[{"text":"3-loop self-energy with two massive lines","anchor":"cb9-3","section":"Showcases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[Times @@ {SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 - Q, 0}, {m^2, 1}, 1}],SFAD[{{p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}] FCLoopGraphPlot[%]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Showcases"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\{-3\\to 2,-1\\to 1,1\\to 3,1\\to 4,2\\to 5,2\\to 6,3\\to 4,3\\to 5,4\\to 6,5\\to 6\\},\\left\\{-Q,Q,\\{\\text{p2},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p2}-Q,1,0\\},\\left\\{\\text{p1}-Q,1,-m^2\\right\\},\\left\\{\\text{p1},1,-m^2\\right\\},\\{\\text{p3},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p2}+\\text{p3},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q,1,0\\},\\{\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q,1,0\\}\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0,\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2-m^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}-Q)^2-m^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},1\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb10-6","section":"Showcases"},{"text":"2-loop triangle","anchor":"cb10-6","section":"Showcases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[FAD[p1, p2, Q1 + p1, Q2 - p1, Q1 + p1 + p2, Q2 - p1 - p2], {p1, p2}] FCLoopGraphPlot[%]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Showcases"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\{-3\\to 3,-2\\to 1,-1\\to 2,1\\to 2,1\\to 5,2\\to 4,3\\to 4,3\\to 5,4\\to 5\\},\\{\\text{Q1}+\\text{Q2},\\text{Q2},\\text{Q1},\\{\\text{p1},1,0\\},\\{\\text{Q2}-\\text{p1},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p1}+\\text{Q1},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{Q1},1,0\\},\\{-\\text{p1}-\\text{p2}+\\text{Q2},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p2},1,0\\}\\},\\left\\{0,0,0,\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{Q1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{Q1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{Q2}-\\text{p1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((-\\text{p1}-\\text{p2}+\\text{Q2})^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},1\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb11-3","section":"Showcases"},{"text":"Not all loop integrals admit a graph representation. Furthermore, an integral may have a weird momentum routing that cannot be automatically recognized by the employed algorithm. Consider e.g.","anchor":"special-cases","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"topo = FCTopology[TRIX1, {SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + Q1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + Q1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{-p1 + Q2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{-p1 - p2 + Q2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2}, {Q1, Q2}, {}, {}]","anchor":"cb12","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{TRIX1},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{Q1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{Q1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{Q2}-\\text{p1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((-\\text{p1}-\\text{p2}+\\text{Q2})^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2}\\},\\{\\text{Q1},\\text{Q2}\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb12-3","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"Here FCLoopIntegralToGraph has no way to know that the actual momentum is Q1+Q2, i.e. it is a 2- and not 3-point function","anchor":"cb12-3","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[topo]","anchor":"cb13","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\[\\text{False}\\]","anchor":"cb13-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"However, if we explicitly provide this information, in many cases the function can still perform the proper reconstruction","anchor":"cb13-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[topo, Momentum -> {Q1 + Q2}] FCLoopGraphPlot[%]","anchor":"cb14","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\{-3\\to 2,-1\\to 1,1\\to 3,1\\to 4,2\\to 3,2\\to 4,3\\to 4\\},\\{-\\text{Q1}-\\text{Q2},\\text{Q1}+\\text{Q2},\\{\\text{p1}+\\text{Q1},1,0\\},\\{\\text{Q2}-\\text{p1},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{Q1},1,0\\},\\{-\\text{p1}-\\text{p2}+\\text{Q2},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p2},1,0\\}\\},\\left\\{0,0,\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{Q1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}+\\text{Q1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{Q2}-\\text{p1})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((-\\text{p1}-\\text{p2}+\\text{Q2})^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},1\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb14-3","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"And here is another example. This NRQCD integral from arXiv:1907.08227 looks like as if it has only one external momentum flowing in","anchor":"cb14-3","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[FAD[{k, m}, l + p, l - p, k + l], {k, l}]","anchor":"cb15","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\[\\text{False}\\]","anchor":"cb15-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"while in reality there are two of them: p and 2p","anchor":"cb15-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[FAD[{k, m}, l + p, l - p, k + l], {k, l}, Momentum -> {2 p, p}, FCE -> True] FCLoopGraphPlot[%]","anchor":"cb16","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\{-4\\to 3,-2\\to 2,-1\\to 1,1\\to 2,1\\to 3,2\\to 3,2\\to 3\\},\\left\\{p,p,2 p,\\{l+p,1,0\\},\\{l-p,1,0\\},\\{k+l,1,0\\},\\left\\{k,1,-m^2\\right\\}\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0,0,\\frac{1}{((l+p)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((k+l)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((l-p)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(k^2-m^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},1\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb16-4","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"In this case the correct form of the external momentum can be deduced upon performing some elementary shifts. The direct application of the function fails","anchor":"cb16-4","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"ex = FCTopology[topo1X12679, {SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}, {Q}, {}, {}]","anchor":"cb17","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo1X12679},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}+\\text{p3})^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p2}-Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p3}-Q)^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2},\\text{p3}\\},\\{Q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb17-2","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[ex]","anchor":"cb18","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\[\\text{False}\\]","anchor":"cb18-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"Yet let us consider","anchor":"cb18-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"exShifted = FCReplaceMomenta[ex, {p2 -> p2 - p3 + p1 - Q, p3 -> p3 - p1 + Q}]","anchor":"cb19","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo1X12679},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}-\\text{p3}-2 Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2},\\text{p3}\\},\\{Q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb19-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"Now we immediately see that the proper external momentum to consider is 2Q instead of just Q","anchor":"cb19-1","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"FCLoopIntegralToGraph[exShifted, Momentum -> {2 Q}] FCLoopGraphPlot[%]","anchor":"cb20","section":"Special cases"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\{-3\\to 2,-1\\to 1,1\\to 2,1\\to 2,1\\to 2,1\\to 2\\},\\{-2 Q,2 Q,\\{\\text{p1},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p2},1,0\\},\\{\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}-\\text{p3}-2 Q,1,0\\},\\{\\text{p3},1,0\\}\\},\\left\\{0,0,\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{((\\text{p1}+\\text{p2}-\\text{p3}-2 Q)^2+i \\eta )},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p3}^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\},1\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb20-3","section":"Special cases"}]